, which blocks redeems and        mints just like a pause, so it is treated as one. The block is read by running the same        checkIsCompliant call the token makes, on the compliance module it points to (compliance()); any        revert there counts as blocked.      - Tighten-only: CF is restored by a governance VIP that reads EBrake.getMarketCFSnapshot() and then        calls EBrake.resetCFSnapshot().      - handleBStockPause is called by trusted keepers; EBrake makes repeat calls no-ops.","errors":{"MarketNotMonitored(address)":[{"params":{"market":"The vToken market address"}}],"MarketNotSupported(address)":[{"params":{"market":"The vToken market address"}}]},"events":{"BStockPauseHandled(address,address,address)":{"details":"Emitted on every handleBStockPause call that finds the token paused or the market blocked, including      repeat calls on a market whose CF is already zero (EBrake then makes no change and emits no      CollateralFactorDecreased event)","params":{"market":"The vToken market address","pauseManager":"The PauseManager the underlying token points to","underlying":"The market's underlying token"}},"Initialized(uint8)":{"details":"Triggered when the contract has been initialized or reinitialized."},"MarketMonitoringUpdated(address,bool)":{"params":{"market":"The vToken market address","monitored":"True if the market was added, false if it was removed"}},"TrustedKeeperUpdated(address,bool)":{"params":{"isTrusted":"Whether the keeper is trusted","keeper":"The keeper address"}}},"kind":"dev","methods":{"acceptOwnership()":{"details":"The new owner accepts the ownership transfer."},"checkBStockPause(address)":{"details":"Returns zeros for a market that is not monitored, and isPaused = false for an underlying token with      no PauseManager. Reads the PauseManager the token itself points to. While the token is not paused, also      runs the token's compliance check for the market; a revert there counts as blocked.      Reverts if the underlying token does not expose pauseManager() or compliance().","params":{"market":"The vToken market address"},"returns":{"isPaused":"True if the market is monitored and its underlying token is paused, or the token's         compliance module rejects the market (sanctioned, or blocklisted for the token)","pauseManager":"The PauseManager the token points to, or address(0) if the market is not monitored or         the token has none","underlying":"The market's underlying token, or address(0) if the market is not monitored"}},"constructor":{"custom:error":"ZeroAddress if eBrake_ is the zero address","custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"constructor","params":{"eBrake_":"Address of the EBrake contract"}},"getMonitoredMarkets()":{"returns":{"_0":"The monitored market addresses, in no particular order"}},"handleBStockPause(address)":{"custom:access":"Only trusted keepers","custom:error":"UnauthorizedKeeper if the caller is not a trusted keeperMarketNotMonitored if the market is not monitoredMarketNotSupported if the underlying token has no PauseManager","custom:event":"Emits BStockPauseHandled when the token is paused or the market blocked","details":"Calls EBrake.decreaseCF(market, 0), which zeroes CF in the market's pool (on the BSC Core pool, also      in every e-mode pool the market is listed in), keeps LT and snapshots the previous CF/LT. Repeat calls      are no-ops in EBrake. The pause and the compliance block are read through checkBStockPause; while      neither holds the call does nothing.      Reverts if the underlying token does not expose pauseManager() or compliance().","params":{"market":"The vToken market address"}},"initialize(address)":{"params":{"accessControlManager_":"Address of the AccessControlManager"}},"isMarketMonitored(address)":{"params":{"market":"The vToken market address"},"returns":{"_0":"True if the market is monitored"}},"owner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"pendingOwner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the pending owner."},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions. Can only be called by the current owner. NOTE: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby disabling any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"setAccessControlManager(address)":{"custom:access":"Only Governance","custom:event":"Emits NewAccessControlManager event","details":"Admin function to set address of AccessControlManager","params":{"accessControlManager_":"The new address of the AccessControlManager"}},"setMarketMonitored(address,bool)":{"custom:access":"Controlled by AccessControlManager","custom:error":"ZeroAddress if market is the zero address","custom:event":"Emits MarketMonitoringUpdated","details":"The market is not checked here: EBrake checks its listing when it zeroes CF, and handleBStockPause      checks its token.","params":{"market":"The vToken market address","monitored":"True to add the market, false to remove it"}},"setTrustedKeeper(address,bool)":{"custom:access":"Controlled by AccessControlManager","custom:error":"ZeroAddress if keeper is the zero address","custom:event":"Emits TrustedKeeperUpdated","params":{"isTrusted":"Whether the keeper should be trusted","keeper":"The keeper address"}},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Starts the ownership transfer of the contract to a new account. Replaces the pending transfer if there is one. Can only be called by the current owner."}},"stateVariables":{"EBRAKE":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"state-variable-immutable"},"__gap":{"details":"Storage gap for future upgrades"},"monitoredMarkets":{"details":"The monitored vToken markets, i.e. the markets handleBStockPause may zero the CF of"}},"title":"BStockPauseSentinel","version":1},"userdoc":{"errors":{"MarketNotMonitored(address)":[{"notice":"Thrown when handleBStockPause is called for a market that is not monitored"}],"MarketNotSupported(address)":[{"notice":"Thrown when braking a market whose underlying token has no PauseManager"}],"Unauthorized(address,address,string)":[{"notice":"Thrown when the action is prohibited by AccessControlManager"}],"UnauthorizedKeeper()":[{"notice":"Thrown when handleBStockPause is called by an address that is not a trusted keeper"}],"ZeroAddress()":[{"notice":"Thrown when a zero address is provided"}]},"events":{"BStockPauseHandled(address,address,address)":{"notice":"Emitted when handleBStockPause asks EBrake to zero the CF of a market whose underlying token is paused         or blocked for the market by the token's compliance module"},"MarketMonitoringUpdated(address,bool)":{"notice":"Emitted when a market is added to or removed from the monitored markets"},"NewAccessControlManager(address,address)":{"notice":"Emitted when access control manager contract address is changed"},"TrustedKeeperUpdated(address,bool)":{"notice":"Emitted when a keeper's trusted status is updated"}},"kind":"user","methods":{"EBRAKE()":{"notice":"Emergency Brake contract used to zero the collateral factor"},"accessControlManager()":{"notice":"Returns the address of the access control manager contract"},"checkBStockPause(address)":{"notice":"Check whether a monitored market's underlying bStock is paused, i.e. whether handleBStockPause would         act on it"},"constructor":{"notice":"Sets EBrake and disables initializers on the implementation"},"getMonitoredMarkets()":{"notice":"The monitored vToken markets"},"handleBStockPause(address)":{"notice":"Zero the collateral factor of a monitored market while its underlying token is paused, or blocked         for the market by the token's compliance module"},"initialize(address)":{"notice":"Initializes the proxy with the AccessControlManager"},"isMarketMonitored(address)":{"notice":"Whether a vToken market is monitored, i.e. handleBStockPause may zero its CF"},"setAccessControlManager(address)":{"notice":"Sets the address of AccessControlManager"},"setMarketMonitored(address,bool)":{"